  "reasoning": "The defendants organized and carried out the illegal excavation of several ancient tombs (Han, Jin, Tang dynasties) at a site under the cultural relics bureau. This conduct constitutes the crime of illegal excavation of tombs, which is covered by the statutory offense of \"盗掘古墓葬罪\" (illegal excavation of ancient tombs) under the law on protection of cultural relics. No other criminal conduct is described, so only this charge applies.",
